{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/667231-animal-protean-form-and-sunlight","id":667231,"title":"Animal Protean form and Sunlight","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-16T10:53:42-07:00","id":667231,"title":"Animal Protean form and Sunlight","content":"So a few years ago I was in a game with someone playing a gangrel who could go out in sun light in Animal Protean form. I don't remember how it was explained it worked. I was wondering if knew how that works / how it's built character sheet wise? <br /> <br /> Mahalo","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1031-youvegotwildtalents","name":"youvegotwildtalents","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T11:00:08-07:00","id":667264,"title":"","content":"Assuming you are using Second Edition animal form offers zero protection against Sunlight. The only possibility that comes to mind is that he's maxed out the Coil of the Ascendant (which is all about getting around the Daysleep, Fire, and Sunlight), but even that (with it's associated anti-sunlight scale) isn't full protection. At best it pulls off Sunlight protection like a Humanity 10, Blood Potency 1 Neonate, while being insanely Vitae and time intensive.<br /> <br /> Perhaps he has some custom power?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span>